    <briefdescription>
<para>Student t-distribution. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Probability density function for <formula id="181">$ n $</formula> degrees of freedom (see mathworld.wolfram.com or wikipedia.org): <formula id="185">\[ f(x) = \frac {\Gamma\left(\frac{n+1}{2}\right)} {\sqrt{n\pi} \, \Gamma\left(\frac{n}{2}\right)}\: \frac {1} {\left(1+\frac{x^2}{n}\right)^{(n+1)/2}} \]</formula> </para>    </detaileddescription>
